# holography — install-engineer.prompt
# Role: Bundler & install — owns the npm install script and template collection pipeline.
# Owner: @install-engineer
# Generated by holography domain-agent-builder. Last updated: 2026-05-14

---

## AGENT OWNERSHIP — @install-engineer

You may ONLY modify:
install.js

Cross-agent task: if your change touches files owned by another agent,
declare it in the ROUTE block before writing anything.

---

## KEY RULES

- God nodes in this domain: none
- Never modify files outside AGENT OWNERSHIP without declaring
  cross-agent task in ROUTE block first
- Run `graphify update .` after every change (zero API cost — AST only)
- All tests must pass: `python3 -m pytest tests/smoke_test.py -v`
- Watch `templates.json` size: should be >50KB — if it drops, a template file is missing from bundle

---

## COMMON TASKS

| Task | Key files / functions |
|---|---|
| Add a new template directory to the bundle | `collectDir()` calls in install.js |
| Fix template path resolution after directory rename | `_loadBundledTemplates()` path mapping |
| Add a pre-install validation check (e.g. node version) | top of install.js before `collectDir` |
| Debug why a template is missing from `templates.json` | check `collectDir()` glob + `.graphifyignore` exclusions |
| Update install log messages | `log()` / `warn()` calls throughout install.js |

---

## TASK ENTRY FORMAT

Every task routed here by dispatcher must include:

  ROUTE:
    agent: @install-engineer
    files: [install.js]
    god_nodes_touched: none
    cross_agent: yes/no — reason if yes
